<IndustryPage {...pageData}>
<p>UK recruitment agencies operate in a fast-moving, competitive market where speed and compliance are everything. The agency that gets the right candidate in front of the client first wins the placement. Yet many UK agencies still rely on a tangle of generic CRM software, spreadsheets for timesheets, and manual compliance checks that slow consultants down and create risk every time a compliance document expires unnoticed.</p>
<p>Off-the-shelf recruitment software is built for the average agency, not your specific model. Generic CRMs don't understand the difference between a temp desk and a perm desk, or the specific compliance requirements of healthcare locums versus construction CSCS cards. Timesheet tools built for general use can't handle the approval workflow your clients demand or the specific pay rules your payroll requires. Job board integration is often limited to a few platforms, forcing consultants to post manually to the rest. Client portals, where they exist, are rigid templates that don't match your branding or your client relationship model.</p>
<p>We build custom software for UK recruitment agencies that streamlines the entire placement lifecycle. From candidate CRM and job board integration to timesheet automation and compliance tracking, we build systems that fit your exact workflows. We understand recruitment - from the consultant's desk to the payroll office - and we build software that integrates with your existing accounting, payroll, and back-office systems. Whether it's a bespoke timesheet app that eliminates the weekly chase or a client portal that lets clients self-serve vacancy submissions and timesheet approvals, bespoke software fits your processes.</p>
<p>Recruitment compliance carries serious consequences. Right-to-work checks, DBS certificates, CSCS cards, and professional qualifications all have expiry dates and specific verification requirements. Placing a candidate with an expired DBS or missing right-to-work documentation isn't just a compliance breach - it's a legal risk. Bespoke software tracks every compliance document, sends automated expiry alerts, and generates audit-ready reports so you never lose a placement to a lapsed certification.</p>
<p>A UK healthcare recruitment agency with 200 active locums was spending two full days each week chasing timesheets and verifying compliance documents. We built a bespoke system with a mobile timesheet app for temps, online approval for clients, and automated compliance tracking with expiry alerts. Timesheet processing time dropped from two days to two hours, compliance-related placement cancellations fell to zero, and the compliance team was redeployed from document chasing to proactive candidate onboarding.</p>
<p>Recruitment is a sector where bespoke software delivers clear ROI. Every placement generates data - candidate interactions, timesheet hours, compliance documents, margin calculations. The opportunity is building software that turns that data into faster placements, automated admin, and real-time visibility across every desk and client.</p>

<p style="margin-top:32px;">Ready to explore bespoke software for your recruitment agency? <a href="/services">View our services</a> or <a href="/contact">book a free discovery call</a> to get started.</p>
